    "description": "BÁU VẬT TRỜI CHO is an emotionally rich, heartwarming film that celebrates family bonds for Tết 2026. Ngọc (Phương Anh Đào), a single mother who conceived her child through donor insemination, takes a seaside getaway to escape her past. There, she and her son Tô unexpectedly encounter Hồng (Tuấn Trần), a free-spirited fisherman who happens to be the donor behind Tô’s birth. This awkward reunion draws three strangers into a series of humorous yet tense situations as everything spirals beyond control. Is this “heaven-sent” father a destined gift, or merely life’s cruel twist of fate?",
